
## Developer docs showcase

Every code block of the [Obsidian developer docs](https://docs.obsidian.md) is a command of this plugin: open the command palette and type `Docs:`. [`src/docs/README.md`](./src/docs/README.md) lists every block, with its command or the reason it has none. Whatever a command shows, a Notice, a modal or a settings tab, links the docs page its code came from, and `Docs showcase: Open the docs page of a snippet` opens that page without running the snippet.
